# Optional: the same single point with SMD (generic "low-polarity" solvent).
# SMD needs a named solvent; diethyl ether (epsilon about 4.2) is a common
# stand-in for the protein environment. Compare with the CPCM eps=4 result.
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-TZVP def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF CPCM

%pal nprocs 16 end
%maxcore 4000

%cpcm
  smd true
  SMDsolvent "diethyl ether"
end

* xyzfile 1 1 orca_opt_reactant.xyz
